usage: plan.py get [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--section SECTION]
                   [--fields FIELDS] [--repo NAME=PATH]
                   plan ref

read one document by reference (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  ref

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --section SECTION     knowledge section id
  --fields FIELDS       comma-separated top-level fields
  --repo NAME=PATH
